{"seq":2,"slug":"radio-interferometry","title":"射电干涉测量：从基线到成像","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/observational-astronomy/telescope-technology/radio-interferometry","wordCount":2806,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"射电干涉测量-从基线到成像\">射电干涉测量：从基线到成像</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>射电干涉测量是现代射电天文学获取高角分辨率的核心技术。通过将分散在数公里乃至数千公里基线上的多台天线组成阵列，利用信号相关处理实现等效口径远超任何单口径望远镜的空间分辨能力。从 1946 年第一次&quot;海崖干涉&quot;实验到当代 SKA 的洲际基线网络，射电干涉测量已发展为一套完整的理论框架和工程体系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>射电干涉测量的全部理论浓缩为一条定理：<strong>可见度是天空亮度的傅里叶分量</strong>（Van Cittert-Zernike 定理）。每对天线在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(u, v)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 平面上采样一个空间频率点（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u, v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 为基线矢量以波长为单位的投影），角分辨率由最长基线决定。成像因此变成&quot;在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(u, v)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 平面上凑够覆盖，再做逆傅里叶变换&quot;的问题；覆盖的缝隙则必须靠标定、去卷积和自标定来弥补。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>决定因素</th>\n<th>物理意义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>可见度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V(u,v)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>两天线信号的互相关函数</td>\n<td>天空亮度分布</td>\n<td>亮度的傅里叶分量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>角分辨率</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>≈</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_{\\min} \\approx \\lambda/B_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>最长基线</td>\n<td>基线越长分辨越细</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(u,v)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 覆盖</td>\n<td>空间频率采样点集合</td>\n<td>阵列构型+地球自转</td>\n<td>决定成像保真度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>脏束（dirty beam）</td>\n<td>不完整覆盖导致的采样图案</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(u,v)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 缝隙</td>\n<td>成像旁瓣的来源</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"物理原理\">物理原理</h2><h3 id=\"van-cittert-zernike-定理\">Van Cittert-Zernike 定理</h3><p>射电干涉测量的理论基础是 Van Cittert-Zernike 定理：远场非相干辐射源的空间相干函数（互相关函数）与源亮度分布构成傅里叶变换对。</p>\n<p>对于天空亮度分布 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I(l, m)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（方向余弦坐标）和基线矢量投影 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(u, v)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（以观测波长为单位），可见度函数（Visibility）定义为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>∫</mo><mo>∫</mo><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mi>l</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>v</mi><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>l</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V(u, v) = \\int\\int I(l, m) \\, e^{-2\\pi i(ul + vm)} \\, dl \\, dm</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2222em;vertical-align:-0.8622em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.4445em;position:relative;top:-0.0011em;\">∫∫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这意味着：每对天线测量的相关输出对应天空亮度分布的一个傅里叶分量。不同基线长度和方向采样不同的空间频率，积累足够的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(u, v)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 覆盖后即可通过逆傅里叶变换恢复天空图像。</p>\n<h3 id=\"基线与角分辨率\">基线与角分辨率</h3><p>干涉阵列的角分辨率由最长基线 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 决定：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mi>λ</mi><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_{\\min} \\approx \\frac{\\lambda}{B_{\\max}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2074em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>设施</th>\n<th>最长基线</th>\n<th>频率</th>\n<th>角分辨率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>VLA (A 配置)</td>\n<td>36 km</td>\n<td>1.4 GHz</td>\n<td>~1.4&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ALMA</td>\n<td>16 km</td>\n<td>345 GHz</td>\n<td>~15 mas</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VLBI (地球直径)</td>\n<td>~12,000 km</td>\n<td>230 GHz</td>\n<td>~20 μas</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间 VLBI</td>\n<td>&gt;地球直径</td>\n<td>22 GHz</td>\n<td>~8 μas</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"相关器\">相关器</h3><p>相关器是干涉阵列的核心信号处理设备。它对每对天线的信号进行互相关运算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mi>j</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{ij}(\\tau) = \\langle V_i(t) \\cdot V_j^*(t - \\tau) \\rangle</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1331em;vertical-align:-0.3831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)⟩</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>通过搜索使相关峰值最大的延迟 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span>，确定波前到达两台天线的几何时间差。现代数字相关器（如 ALMA 的 64 输入 × 32 子带相关器）以 FPGA 或 GPU 实现高速实时运算。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[天线 1 信号] --&gt; C[数字化采样]&#10;    B[天线 2 信号] --&gt; D[数字化采样]&#10;    C --&gt; E[延迟补偿]&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F[互相关运算]&#10;    F --&gt; G[可见度数据]&#10;    G --&gt; H[标定与成像]\">flowchart LR\n    A[天线 1 信号] --&gt; C[数字化采样]\n    B[天线 2 信号] --&gt; D[数字化采样]\n    C --&gt; E[延迟补偿]\n    D --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F[互相关运算]\n    F --&gt; G[可见度数据]\n    G --&gt; H[标定与成像]</pre><h2 id=\"uv-平面采样\">UV 平面采样</h2><h3 id=\"地球自转综合孔径\">地球自转综合孔径</h3><p>单一基线在观测过程中，由于地球自转使基线矢量在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(u, v)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 平面上划出椭圆弧。长时间观测（~12 小时）积累的弧线轨迹提供丰富的空间频率采样，这就是&quot;地球自转综合孔径&quot;技术。</p>\n<h3 id=\"快照模式与瞬时覆盖\">快照模式与瞬时覆盖</h3><p>对于变源或需要大量目标的巡天，无法等待完整地球自转。此时需要大量天线同时工作——N 台天线提供 N(N-1)/2 条独立基线，快速填充 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(u, v)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 平面。VLA 的 27 台天线提供 351 条基线，ALMA 的 66 台天线提供 2145 条基线。</p>\n<h3 id=\"阵列配置\">阵列配置</h3><p>阵列天线的空间分布决定了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(u, v)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 覆盖的特征：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>配置类型</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>代表</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Y 形</td>\n<td>均匀基线分布，快照覆盖好</td>\n<td>VLA</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>螺旋形</td>\n<td>径向分布优化</td>\n<td>ALMA</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>随机分布</td>\n<td>长短基线混合</td>\n<td>MeerKAT</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>核心+外站</td>\n<td>高灵敏度+高分辨率</td>\n<td>SKA</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"标定与成像\">标定与成像</h2><h3 id=\"标定流程\">标定流程</h3><p>射电干涉数据在成像前需经历多步标定：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>带通标定</strong>：修正通道间增益和相位变化</li>\n<li><strong>复数增益标定</strong>：通过观测已知校准源，确定每台天线的时变增益和相位</li>\n<li><strong>极化标定</strong>：修正仪器极化泄漏</li>\n<li><strong>大气相位校正</strong>：补偿对流层水汽和电离层引起的相位波动</li>\n</ol>\n<p>标定精度直接决定最终图像的动态范围。现代阵列通常要求振幅标定精度 &lt;5%，相位精度 &lt;5°。</p>\n<h3 id=\"成像算法\">成像算法</h3><p>从标定后的可见度数据到天空图像的转换涉及逆问题求解：</p>\n<p><strong>脏图（Dirty Image）</strong>：直接对可见度数据进行逆傅里叶变换，但由于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(u, v)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 覆盖不完整，产生严重的旁瓣（脏束，dirty beam）。</p>\n<p><strong>CLEAN 算法</strong>：Högbom（1974）提出的迭代去卷积算法，假设天空由点源组成：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>在脏图中找到最亮峰值</li>\n<li>减去该位置的脏束（按一定增益因子）</li>\n<li>记录&quot;CLEAN 分量&quot;</li>\n<li>重复直至残差图中无显著信号</li>\n<li>将 CLEAN 分量与理想束卷积，加上残差图</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>多尺度 CLEAN</strong>：扩展到有弥散结构的源，同时搜索点状和扩展分量。</p>\n<p><strong>最大熵方法（MEM）</strong>：在满足数据约束的解中选择熵最大（最平滑）的图像，适合低信噪比弥散源。</p>\n<h3 id=\"自标定-self-calibration\">自标定（Self-Calibration）</h3><p>当天空模型足够好时，可以反过来用源本身作为校准参考，迭代修正天线增益和相位。自标定可将动态范围从几百提升至数万甚至百万。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    A[初始标定数据] --&gt; B[初步成像 CLEAN]&#10;    B --&gt; C[源模型]&#10;    C --&gt; D[用模型反解天线增益]&#10;    D --&gt; E[修正可见度]&#10;    E --&gt; B&#10;    B --&gt; F[收敛? 最终图像]\">flowchart TB\n    A[初始标定数据] --&gt; B[初步成像 CLEAN]\n    B --&gt; C[源模型]\n    C --&gt; D[用模型反解天线增益]\n    D --&gt; E[修正可见度]\n    E --&gt; B\n    B --&gt; F[收敛? 最终图像]</pre><h2 id=\"代表性设施\">代表性设施</h2><h3 id=\"alma-阿塔卡马大型毫米-亚毫米阵列\">ALMA（阿塔卡马大型毫米/亚毫米阵列）</h3><p>ALMA 位于智利阿塔卡马沙漠海拔 5050 m 的 Chajnantor 高原，是世界最强大的毫米/亚毫米波干涉阵列：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>数值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>天线数量</td>\n<td>66 台（50×12m + 12×7m + 4×12m）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>频率范围</td>\n<td>84–950 GHz（Band 3–10）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最长基线</td>\n<td>16 km</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>角分辨率（最佳）</td>\n<td>~5 mas @ 950 GHz</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>灵敏度</td>\n<td>~μJy/beam（长积分）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>ALMA 的科学贡献涵盖原行星盘精细结构（HL Tau 环缝系统的标志性图像）、高红移星系的分子气体观测、恒星形成区的化学复杂度研究等。</p>\n<h3 id=\"vla-ngvla\">VLA/ngVLA</h3><p>Karl G. Jansky 甚大阵列（VLA）27 台 25 m 天线排列成 Y 形，覆盖 1–50 GHz。其下一代升级方案 ngVLA（next-generation VLA）计划部署 263 台 18 m 天线于美国西南部，基线可达洲际尺度，频率覆盖 1.2–116 GHz，灵敏度比 VLA 提升约 10 倍。</p>\n<h3 id=\"meerkat-ska-mid\">MeerKAT / SKA-Mid</h3><p>MeerKAT 是南非的 64 台 13.5 m 天线阵列，最长基线 8 km，已在连续谱巡天和脉冲星搜索中产出重要成果。作为 SKA-Mid 的先导阵列，它将被整合入 SKA Phase 1 的 197 台天线网络。</p>\n<h3 id=\"事件视界望远镜-eht\">事件视界望远镜（EHT）</h3><p>EHT 是全球毫米波 VLBI 网络的终极实现——将分布在各大洲的约 11 台（亚）毫米波望远镜/阵列组成地球尺度的干涉仪，在 230 GHz（1.3 mm）实现约 20 微角秒的角分辨率。</p>\n<p>EHT 的关键技术挑战：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>超宽带记录</strong>：每台站以 64 Gbps 速率记录数据到硬盘阵列</li>\n<li><strong>氢原子钟同步</strong>：各站点依赖独立氢原子频标保持相位相参</li>\n<li><strong>大气相位校正</strong>：230 GHz 观测受对流层水汽影响严重，需要水汽辐射计实时修正</li>\n<li><strong>稀疏覆盖成像</strong>：仅约十条基线的极稀疏 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(u, v)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 覆盖要求先进的成像算法（CHIRP、RML 等）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>2025 年 9 月，EHT 发布了 M87* 的 2017–2021 年多历元偏振图像，发现黑洞附近偏振方向在 4 年间发生翻转——从逆时针变为顺时针——证实了事件视界附近磁化等离子体的剧烈动力学过程。同时首次在 EHT 数据中发现连接环状结构与喷流底部的延伸辐射迹象。2026 年初发表的 OJ 287（超大质量双黑洞候选体）首次 EHT 观测结果，实现 18 微角秒分辨率，揭示内喷流在 5 天内的显著结构和偏振变化。</p>\n<h3 id=\"下一代-eht-ngeht\">下一代 EHT（ngEHT）</h3><p>ngEHT 计划增加约 10 个新站点、升级至 345 GHz 观测频率和更宽带宽，目标实现：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>黑洞阴影的实时&quot;电影&quot;</li>\n<li>光子环的直接探测（绕黑洞多圈的光子轨道特征）</li>\n<li>直接测量黑洞自旋</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"甚长基线干涉测量-vlbi\">甚长基线干涉测量（VLBI）</h2><h3 id=\"原理与独特性\">原理与独特性</h3><p>VLBI 与连通基线干涉不同，各台站独立记录数据后在计算中心进行离线相关。关键区别：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>无实时参考信号传输——依赖各站独立原子钟</li>\n<li>相位标定依赖对地面模型和大气模型的精确建模</li>\n<li>灵敏度受限于单站收集能力（无法&quot;加天线&quot;增加灵敏度）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"科学应用\">科学应用</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>活动星系核喷流</strong>：追踪超光速运动分量</li>\n<li><strong>天体测量</strong>：μas 精度的绝对位置和自行测量（ICRF 天球参考框架）</li>\n<li><strong>大地测量</strong>：板块运动、地球自转参数（UT1-UTC）的精确测定</li>\n<li><strong>空间导航</strong>：深空探测器的精确定位</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前沿方向\">前沿方向</h2><p>射电干涉测量技术正向以下方向发展：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>空间 VLBI</strong>：将天线放置于地球轨道或日-地 L2 点，基线超越地球直径限制</li>\n<li><strong>宽带数字后端</strong>：数 GHz 瞬时带宽的全数字处理链</li>\n<li><strong>AI 辅助标定与成像</strong>：深度学习重建高保真图像，应对稀疏覆盖挑战</li>\n<li><strong>相控阵馈源（PAF）</strong>：在焦面放置天线阵列，同时合成多个波束，大幅提升巡天速度</li>\n<li><strong>频率相位转移</strong>（FPT）：利用低频大气相位校正高频观测数据，提高 mm/submm VLBI 的相参时间</li>\n</ul>\n<p>射电干涉测量正从专家级技术向自动化管线演进，使更多科学家能够利用干涉成像探索宇宙。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>射电干涉测量的理论基石是 Van Cittert-Zernike 定理：可见度是天空亮度的傅里叶分量，基线长度决定角分辨率。</li>\n<li>相关器对每对天线做互相关得到复数可见度；N 台天线提供 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N(N-1)/2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span></span></span></span></span> 条基线，快照即可部分填充 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(u, v)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 平面。</li>\n<li>地球自转综合孔径通过长时间观测把单条基线在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(u, v)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 平面上画成椭圆弧，弥补瞬时覆盖的不足。</li>\n<li>标定（带通、复增益、极化、大气相位）决定动态范围；成像用脏图、CLEAN 与最大熵等方法去卷积，自标定可将动态范围提升数个量级。</li>\n<li>代表性设施覆盖米波到亚毫米波：ALMA、VLA/ngVLA、MeerKAT/SKA-Mid，以及地球尺度的 EHT（~20 μas，已观测到 M87* 偏振翻转）。</li>\n<li>发展趋势包括空间 VLBI、宽带数字后端、AI 辅助成像与相控阵馈源。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"射电干涉测量：从基线到成像","id":"射电干涉测量-从基线到成像"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"物理原理","id":"物理原理"},{"level":3,"text":"Van Cittert-Zernike 定理","id":"van-cittert-zernike-定理"},{"level":3,"text":"基线与角分辨率","id":"基线与角分辨率"},{"level":3,"text":"相关器","id":"相关器"},{"level":2,"text":"UV 平面采样","id":"uv-平面采样"},{"level":3,"text":"地球自转综合孔径","id":"地球自转综合孔径"},{"level":3,"text":"快照模式与瞬时覆盖","id":"快照模式与瞬时覆盖"},{"level":3,"text":"阵列配置","id":"阵列配置"},{"level":2,"text":"标定与成像","id":"标定与成像"},{"level":3,"text":"标定流程","id":"标定流程"},{"level":3,"text":"成像算法","id":"成像算法"},{"level":3,"text":"自标定（Self-Calibration）","id":"自标定-self-calibration"},{"level":2,"text":"代表性设施","id":"代表性设施"},{"level":3,"text":"ALMA（阿塔卡马大型毫米/亚毫米阵列）","id":"alma-阿塔卡马大型毫米-亚毫米阵列"},{"level":3,"text":"VLA/ngVLA","id":"vla-ngvla"},{"level":3,"text":"MeerKAT / SKA-Mid","id":"meerkat-ska-mid"},{"level":3,"text":"事件视界望远镜（EHT）","id":"事件视界望远镜-eht"},{"level":3,"text":"下一代 EHT（ngEHT）","id":"下一代-eht-ngeht"},{"level":2,"text":"甚长基线干涉测量（VLBI）","id":"甚长基线干涉测量-vlbi"},{"level":3,"text":"原理与独特性","id":"原理与独特性"},{"level":3,"text":"科学应用","id":"科学应用"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿方向","id":"前沿方向"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"光学望远镜设计：从折射到分段反射","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/observational-astronomy/telescope-technology/optical-telescope-design"},"next":{"title":"空间望远镜：突破大气层的限制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/observational-astronomy/telescope-technology/space-telescopes"}}